{"logId": "fbb402f6-63e8-4e1d-83c9-2a1a8bbae8e3", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [169, 139, 562, 174], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[169.0, 139.0], [562.0, 139.0], [562.0, 174.0], [169.0, 174.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "下，让孩子独立完成他要做的事，哪怕会出错；孩子丢三落四不提醒、不帮忙、不管他，让他自己学会对重要的事情上心", "block_bbox": [180, 213, 1014, 270], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 213.0], [1014.0, 213.0], [1014.0, 270.0], [180.0, 270.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）青少年时期的独立能力：独立做饭、独立做家务的能力；独立安排学习计划的能力", "block_bbox": [188, 276, 883, 303], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[188.0, 276.0], [883.0, 276.0], [883.0, 303.0], [188.0, 303.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、无论孩子处于什么成长阶段，都能够真正地和孩子成为朋友", "block_bbox": [180, 308, 686, 334], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 308.0], [686.0, 308.0], [686.0, 334.0], [180.0, 334.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）蹲下来和孩子说话，眼睛与孩子水平对视", "block_bbox": [190, 337, 563, 366], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[190.0, 337.0], [563.0, 337.0], [563.0, 366.0], [190.0, 366.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）说话算数，答应孩子的事情要守信，不轻易爽约", "block_bbox": [191, 369, 616, 397], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 369.0], [616.0, 369.0], [616.0, 397.0], [191.0, 397.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）教孩子与各种成年人自由、平等交往", "block_bbox": [192, 400, 527, 427], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 400.0], [527.0, 400.0], [527.0, 427.0], [192.0, 427.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）陪孩子一起做他喜欢的事情或活动", "block_bbox": [192, 431, 509, 458], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 431.0], [509.0, 431.0], [509.0, 458.0], [192.0, 458.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（5）带孩子去他喜欢的地方参观", "block_bbox": [192, 462, 456, 490], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 462.0], [456.0, 462.0], [456.0, 490.0], [192.0, 490.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（6）允许孩子参与家庭事务的计划或决定", "block_bbox": [192, 494, 525, 521], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 494.0], [525.0, 494.0], [525.0, 521.0], [192.0, 521.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（7）尊重和保护孩子的隐私和权利，给孩子独立的精神成长空间（如进孩子屋要敲门等）", "block_bbox": [191, 524, 888, 552], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 524.0], [888.0, 524.0], [888.0, 552.0], [191.0, 552.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（8）会主动地给孩子道歉", "block_bbox": [193, 556, 401, 582], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 556.0], [401.0, 556.0], [401.0, 582.0], [193.0, 582.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（9）能够与孩子保持真诚、直接、没有任何保留的沟通", "block_bbox": [191, 587, 633, 614], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 587.0], [633.0, 587.0], [633.0, 614.0], [191.0, 614.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、引导孩子懂得先进的生活理念，塑造正确的人生观、世界观和价值观", "block_bbox": [180, 618, 757, 646], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 618.0], [757.0, 618.0], [757.0, 646.0], [180.0, 646.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[68]", "block_bbox": [572, 714, 613, 740], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[572.0, 714.0], [612.0, 714.0], [612.0, 739.0], [572.0, 739.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [205, 899, 598, 934], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[205.0, 899.0], [598.0, 899.0], [598.0, 934.0], [205.0, 934.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）教育孩子以喜欢的状态做人做事，不为了追求名利、荣耀、面子等", "block_bbox": [227, 973, 796, 1000], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[227.0, 973.0], [796.0, 973.0], [796.0, 1000.0], [227.0, 1000.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）教育孩子不追求学历和竞争，不功利地学习，受教育和积累知识是为了辅助人生", "block_bbox": [228, 1004, 902, 1031], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1004.0], [902.0, 1004.0], [902.0, 1031.0], [228.0, 1031.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）教育孩子怎么面对生活和生命，怎样个性、自由、勇敢地活自己，鼓励他们去过自己热爱的生活", "block_bbox": [228, 1035, 1025, 1063], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1035.0], [1025.0, 1035.0], [1025.0, 1063.0], [228.0, 1063.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）鼓励他们主宰自己的人生，轻松、乐观地规划人生", "block_bbox": [228, 1066, 671, 1093], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1066.0], [671.0, 1066.0], [671.0, 1093.0], [228.0, 1093.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、重视对孩子的创新教育，培养孩子的创新思维和创新能力", "block_bbox": [218, 1097, 704, 1124], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1097.0], [704.0, 1097.0], [704.0, 1124.0], [218.0, 1124.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）发掘孩子潜力和兴趣爱好，帮助孩子培养特长", "block_bbox": [228, 1127, 635, 1154], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1127.0], [635.0, 1127.0], [635.0, 1154.0], [228.0, 1154.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）鼓励和培养孩子的创造能力，不墨守成规", "block_bbox": [228, 1157, 599, 1184], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1157.0], [599.0, 1157.0], [599.0, 1184.0], [228.0, 1184.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、对孩子进行必要的性教育，包括性启蒙教育和生理安全教育", "block_bbox": [218, 1188, 721, 1215], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1188.0], [721.0, 1188.0], [721.0, 1215.0], [218.0, 1215.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）营造轻松谈论性的家庭氛围，切忌回避孩子的性问题或严肃谈论", "block_bbox": [228, 1219, 775, 1246], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1219.0], [775.0, 1219.0], [775.0, 1246.0], [228.0, 1246.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）借助书籍及视频对7岁以上的少年儿童传授妊娠和生育知识", "block_bbox": [228, 1249, 734, 1276], "block_id": 25, "block_order": 26, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1249.0], [734.0, 1249.0], [734.0, 1276.0], [228.0, 1276.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）借助书籍及视频对青少年讲授生理与身体机能知识", "block_bbox": [228, 1279, 671, 1307], "block_id": 26, "block_order": 27, "group_id": 26, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1279.0], [671.0, 1279.0], [671.0, 1307.0], [228.0, 1307.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）提醒恋爱期的子女注意性爱安全及避孕", "block_bbox": [229, 1310, 582, 1337], "block_id": 27, "block_order": 28, "group_id": 27, "block_polygon_points": [[229.0, 1310.0], [582.0, 1310.0], [582.0, 1337.0], [229.0, 1337.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、发自内心地尊重子女，不干涉他们自主规划和选择人生状态", "block_bbox": [217, 1341, 724, 1368], "block_id": 28, "block_order": 29, "group_id": 28, "block_polygon_points": [[223.0, 1341.0], [723.0, 1341.0], [723.0, 1367.0], [223.0, 1367.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）尊重孩子的能力，不苛求、也不溺爱孩子", "block_bbox": [228, 1372, 600, 1399], "block_id": 29, "block_order": 30, "group_id": 29, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 1372.0], [600.0, 1372.0], [600.0, 1399.0], [228.0, 1399.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）尊重子女自由择业", "block_bbox": [229, 1403, 419, 1429], "block_id": 30, "block_order": 31, "group_id": 30, "block_polygon_points": [[229.0, 1403.0], [419.0, 1403.0], [419.0, 1429.0], [229.0, 1429.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[69]", "block_bbox": [610, 1476, 650, 1498], "block_id": 31, "block_order": null, "group_id": 31, "block_polygon_points": [[610.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [610.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8359864950180054, "coordinate": [169, 139, 562, 174], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[169.0, 139.0], [562.0, 139.0], [562.0, 174.0], [169.0, 174.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7112491726875305, "coordinate": [180, 213, 1014, 270], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[180.0, 213.0], [1014.0, 213.0], [1014.0, 270.0], [180.0, 270.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7930421829223633, "coordinate": [188, 276, 883, 303], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[188.0, 276.0], [883.0, 276.0], [883.0, 303.0], [188.0, 303.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7638832330703735, "coordinate": [180, 308, 686, 334], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[180.0, 308.0], [686.0, 308.0], [686.0, 334.0], [180.0, 334.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7624603509902954, "coordinate": [190, 337, 563, 366], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[190.0, 337.0], [563.0, 337.0], [563.0, 366.0], [190.0, 366.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7824907302856445, "coordinate": [191, 369, 616, 397], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[191.0, 369.0], [616.0, 369.0], [616.0, 397.0], [191.0, 397.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7660493850708008, "coordinate": [192, 400, 527, 427], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[192.0, 400.0], [527.0, 400.0], [527.0, 427.0], [192.0, 427.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22